# Review ownership for ProofOS.
#
# WHAT THIS FILE IS
#   A record of who is responsible for which surfaces, so that a change to an
#   authority-critical path is never reviewed by accident.
#
# WHAT THIS FILE IS NOT
#   It is not proof that a review happened, and by itself it enforces nothing.
#   GitHub only requires Code Owner approval when branch protection or a
#   repository ruleset says so, and no such configuration has been applied to
#   this repository. See docs/governance/branch-protection-design.md, which is
#   a design, not a deployed state.
#
#   This project has one maintainer. Recording ownership honestly means
#   recording that the owner and the only available reviewer are the same
#   person. Enforcing Code Owner review under that arrangement would lock the
#   repository against its own maintainer while proving nothing about
#   independence, so the design deliberately does not enable it yet.
#
# Paths below are restricted to directories that actually exist in this tree.

# Default owner for everything not matched more specifically.
*                           @koreaelonmusk

# --- the verification kernel and the evidence it accepts ---------------------
# Changes here can alter what counts as authority. Highest review bar.
/proofos/                   @koreaelonmusk

# --- the tests and gates that are the only reason to believe the kernel ------
/tests/                     @koreaelonmusk
/scripts/                   @koreaelonmusk

# --- deployable surfaces that hold or move evidence --------------------------
/proofos_collector/         @koreaelonmusk
/proofos_service/           @koreaelonmusk
/proofos_agent/             @koreaelonmusk

# --- automation, which decides what "green" means ----------------------------
/.github/workflows/         @koreaelonmusk
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @koreaelonmusk

# --- governance and security documents ---------------------------------------
/SECURITY.md                @koreaelonmusk
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @koreaelonmusk
/docs/governance/           @koreaelonmusk

